 2755: //    Output: false: no intersection or colinear; true: exactly 1 intersection.	
 2756: //    If true, (xIntersect,yIntersect) is the intersection.				
 2757: //    Modified to only check tt2, assuming 0<=tt1<=1 is already assured. 
 2758: // **/
